Olive is an [[Bestiary/Realmtouched#Aasimar|Aasimar]] in her late-60s with dark, sunbaked skin and a pair of white wings.

A guardian angel from the [[Org/Althane/Church of the Thirteenth Realm|Church of the Thirteenth Realm]] who is currently travelling the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Gulch]] with [[People/Althane/Jude Bell|Jude Bell]].
